  "name": "Red Curry Paste - Thai Bible",
  "text": "Red Curry Paste - Thai Bible\n\nYield: 2-4 curries\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nIngredients\n\n1 tsp toasted coriander seeds,\n\n½ tsp toasted cumin seeds,\n\n1 tsp black peppercorns,\n\n1 tsp dried chilli flakes,\n\n½ tsp shrimp paste,\n\n2 tbsp chopped lemongrass,\n\n3 tbsp chopped onions,\n\n2 tsp chopped galangal,\n\n1 tbsp chopped garlic,\n\n3 tbsp deseeded chopped red chillies,\n\n1-2 tbsp ground sweet paprika (optional),\n\n1-2 tbsp oil,\n\n2-3 pinches of salt.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Combine all ingredients and grind to a smooth paste.",
  "recipeYield": "2-4 curries",
